        "type": "text_on_accent",
        "min_contrast": 4.5,
        "candidates": [
          "#ffffff",
          "#24211d"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "fit": "If a rule fails, mix the brand colour with white or with black in 1 % steps and keep the first that passes every rule (try white then black at each step). Use that colour for the whole accent layer of the card.",
    "on_accent": "For colour 'on_accent', use the candidate with the higher contrast on the fitted accent."
  },
  "video": {
    "duration": 6.0,
    "fps": 25,
    "frames": 150,
    "loop": "seamless: the frame after the last one is the first one",
    "accent_video": "alpha as luma, full range (yuvj420p): read it with format=gray before alphamerge",
    "compose": {
      "loops": 2,
      "exit": {
        "effect": "fade",
        "duration": 0.5
      },
      "note": "Telegram plays an animation in a loop. The card lasts two loops of the background; the texts come in at the start and fade out in the last 0.5 s, so the restart is clean. D = loops * duration."
    }
